d77fe0d Integer detector runtime replicated: 6:56 / 105 GB on the emptiness A/B arm
259fef3 Docs: today's window-loop performance line -- parallel-array gate and task pool adopted, integer detector held pending both engines
1279a5d Integer detector beats the OpenMS path: 6:53 vs 7:17 wall, 105 vs 164 GB peak, at −1.4% peptides pending the emptiness A/B
146f4a0 Integer detector: A/B toggle for frame emptiness (raw vs after sub-noise deletion)
4521f05 Integer detector: valley splitting chunked and parallel, as the OpenMS path does it
