  1485	docs/reviews/window-loop-perf-2026-09-03/codex.md:161:| 2 | Retain the current `buildFragGrid` rewrite: avoid the all-support RT temporary, parallel-fill CSR and consume XICs in place ([implementation](//Users/kohlbach/Claude/speXtractor/src/DIAPseudoSpectra.cpp:716)). | Approximately 3–4% total wall; potentially 2–4 GB less transient memory per heavy window. | Low–medium; output-neutral only if RT set and per-fragment arithmetic remain identical. | Compare per-window trace/grid digests and correlations near the 0.3 cutoff; log RSS before and after grid construction. |
