  1627	docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:104:**Comparison:** Banded run vs **bands=1** (unpartitioned) on the same window.
  1628	docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:114:1. Run **one** representative window unbanded (bands=1) → reference trace set T₁
  1629	docs/reviews/banding-halo-2026-09-03/vibe.md:115:2. Run the **same window** with bands=N → trace set T_N
