  1434	   402	  /// Peaks that cannot be represented exactly are DROPPED and COUNTED, never silently altered.
  1435	   403	  /// [adv-fix] The first version CLAMPED out-of-range 1/K0 to IM_LO/IM_HI, which would pin outliers
  1436	   404	  /// from many frames onto two artificial, perfectly-aligned mobility values — manufacturing spurious
  1437	   405	  /// traces out of nothing. NaN also passed straight through clamp into llround (UB on unsigned
  1438	   406	  /// conversion). Dropping + counting is the only defensible behaviour.
