  1842	  1457	    // INTENSITIES change: RT positions, touched grid points and the overlap count are untouched,
  1843	  1458	    // so this cannot silently redefine the min_correlation_points gate. Fragment XICs stay RAW
  1844	  1459	    // (the reference implementation smooths only the precursor side), and emitted peak intensities are unaffected
