  1899	  1514	        // [C9 A/B, 2026-09-02] 28% of emitted spectra carry the precursor's M+1 and 25% its M+2 as
  1900	  1515	        // "fragments" (unfragmented survivors). SPEXTRACTOR_DROP_PREC_ISO=1 drops M+1..M+3 (z known) too.
