  4188	  1555	          // not the full grid G. Removes the [B0] zero-padding: no ~1300 implicit zeros inflating
  4189	  1556	          // sparse fragments, no dependence on grid size. n = |touched U f.support|. fsum/fsumsq
  4190	  1557	          // over f.support are accumulated here (support is tiny, so a second pass is negligible).
