* 3bdcb60 Comment: FragStats, not FragGrid
* 3a1d91e Trace profiles are spans, not point lists: entry frame + intensities in a per-store arena
* a3ce034 Trace-struct redesign, revision 2 after adversarial review: presence semantics, G and MS1-MS2 alignment kept as small tables, stored scalars for the OpenMS path, arena sequencing, corrected bound (1/r), staged falsifier
* 1ed875b Design: the trace struct has one degree of freedom per point and stores three
* 9adcfcf Memory analysis of the integer detector: measured per-structure ledger, duplication, repeated passes, and a ranked plan
* 4bd81c2 Integer detector, both engines: Sage -1.3%, MSFragger +2.1%, entrapment lower; both A/B attributions were null
* 4a22ad7 dataset A confirms the integer detector: 140 GB vs 230 GB, peptides +0.3% (the dataset D deficit does not reproduce)
* d951e48 Instrument per-structure memory: a byte ledger over the window loop's data structures
* 1316813 Integer detector: 'closest' measured in m/z again -- the bin metric cost 1.4% of peptides and bought no time
